sequenceDiagram
    actor S1 as Student A (wanted post)
    actor S2 as Student B (lister)
    participant FE as React Client
    participant API as Express API
    participant MATCH as Matching Service (FastAPI)
    participant REDIS as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant NOTIF as Notification Dispatcher
    participant SOCK as Socket.io
    participant DB as MongoDB

    S1->>FE: Create wanted post
    FE->>API: POST /wanted-posts
    API->>DB: save WantedPost (status=open)

    S2->>FE: Publish new listing
    FE->>API: POST /listings
    API->>DB: save Listing
    API->>MATCH: POST /match/evaluate {listingId}
    MATCH->>DB: fetch open wanted posts
    MATCH->>MATCH: compute semantic similarity (embeddings)
    alt match found above threshold
        MATCH->>DB: create MatchEvent
        MATCH->>REDIS: publish match.found {wantedPostId, listingId}
        REDIS->>NOTIF: consume match.found
        NOTIF->>DB: create Notification for Student A
        NOTIF->>SOCK: emit notification (if online)
        SOCK-->>FE: real-time notification
        NOTIF-->>S1: email/push (if offline)
    else no match
        MATCH-->>API: no matches
    end
